### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health


### Get listings without token - should return 401
GET http://localhost:4000/api/listings


### Signup
# @name signup
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}


### Login as Kathir
# @name login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kathir@gmail.com",
  "password": "pass1234"
}


### Get current user's listings
GET http://localhost:4000/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}


### Create listing for current user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/listings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "title": "Day 35 Token Listing",
  "city": "Chennai",
  "price": 22000,
  "status": "available"
}


### Update current user's listing
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/listings/15
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Token Listing",
  "city": "Chennai",
  "price": 25000,
  "status": "pending"
}


### Delete current user's listing
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/listings/15
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
